OL,4,CPakistan's first astronaut goes to     
OL,5,Cspace aboard Chinese rocket            
OL,6,GChina has launched its Shenzhou-24     
OL,7,Gspace mission today to bring three     
OL,8,Gastronauts to its Tiangong space       
OL,9,Gstation, including a Pakistani man.    
OL,11,FPakistan's Muhammad Zeeshan Ali will   
OL,12,Fbe the first foreign national to board 
OL,13,Fthe Tiangong space station. Beijing    
OL,14,Fand Islamabad signed a space co-       
OL,15,Foperation agreement last year.         
OL,17,FAli says he carries with him the "the  
OL,18,Fname of Pakistan on my shoulder, the   
OL,19,Fhopes of 250 million Pakistanis".      
OL,22,                                   G1/2 
