OL,4,CFrench ex-President Sarkozy and wife   
OL,5,CCarla Bruni to face trial              
OL,6,GNicolas Sarkozy and his wife Carla     
OL,7,GBruni-Sarkozy are to face trial next   
OL,8,Gyear over charges stemming from the    
OL,9,Gformer French president's conviction   
OL,10,Gfor conspiring to fund his election    
OL,11,Gcampaign with money from late Libyan   
OL,12,Gdictator Muammar Gaddafi.              
OL,14,FThe charges centre on the retraction   
OL,15,Fof the testimony of a key witness who  
OL,16,Fhad initially said he had evidence     
OL,17,Fthat could incriminate Sarkozy.        
OL,19,FThe pair deny any wrongdoing.          
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
