OL,4,CThird of young Brits have never had    
OL,5,Csex, but many are sexting and watching 
OL,6,Cporn                                   
OL,7,GBritish people, particularly teens and 
OL,8,Gyoung adults, are having less or no    
OL,9,Gsex compared to past generations, but  
OL,10,Glots are watching porn and sexting, a  
OL,11,Gmajor study reveals.                   
OL,13,FIt is the first time The National      
OL,14,FSurvey of Sexual Attitudes and         
OL,15,FLifestyles' (Natsal) research into     
OL,16,Fgeneral public sex lives has asked     
OL,17,Fabout online behaviours.               
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
