OL,4,CLand mine casualties soar in Syria,    
OL,5,Ctwo years after war                    
OL,6,GEleven-year-old Alaa was tending her   
OL,7,Gfamily's goats with her siblings in a  
OL,8,Gfield behind their home in Umm         
OL,9,GKhuzaym, north-west Syria, on Sunday   
OL,10,Gwhen there was a flash and a deafening 
OL,11,Gbang.                                  
OL,13,F"Then we heard people screaming,"      
OL,14,FAlaa's father, Walid Mohammed Al-      
OL,15,FGhafar, told the BBC.                  
OL,17,FWalid ran outside to find his daughter 
OL,18,Flying face down, killed, and her 10-   
OL,19,Fyear-old brother, Mahmoud, seriously   
OL,20,Finjured.                               
